     "html": "<p>Hi {{ contact.firstname }},</p>\n<div data-block-id=\"block-1b650049-baea-4309-ac66-f28753056020\">\n<p>You\u2019ve now seen how easy it is to create a line of high-quality supplements with <span style=\"background:#FFF3CD;border-bottom:2px solid #8A6300;\" data-praxera-review=\"brand\">Praxera</span>.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>We start with a discovery call that helps us understand your practice and patient needs. We then create a professional, patient-centric label design that satisfies all brand and legal requirements.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Lastly, we will order and deliver your products. All of our private label supplements are scientifically reviewed for efficacy and quality before they go into production in U.S. facilities. Our parent company, FoodScience\u00ae, is an FDA-registered food facility and is GMP certified to SQF food safety and NSF GMP 455-2 standards. &nbsp;</p>\n<ol></ol>\n<p>Your representative will stay in close touch with you after the product launch, gathering feedback, managing reorders, and supporting your practice as you scale.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Benefits of Private Labeling Supplements With <span style=\"background:#FFF3CD;border-bottom:2px solid #8A6300;\" data-praxera-review=\"brand\">Praxera</span>\u00ae Laboratories</h2>\n<p>Partnering with a reputable private-label supplement company is the most effective way to build your business. Here are three reasons to collaborate with us:&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Doctor-Formulated Supplements: </strong>Our research and development team collaborates with our Scientific Review Board to design premium supplement formulas and provide valuable clinical insights for every product.&nbsp;<br><br></li>\n<li><strong>Truth in Labeling:</strong> All our supplements use therapeutic levels of ingredients and don\u2019t include extra fillers. Each product also gets scientifically reviewed for quality, potency, and safety. What you see on the label is what you get \u2014 100% guaranteed.&nbsp;<br><br></li>\n<li><strong>Low MOQs:</strong> <span style=\"background:#FFF3CD;border-bottom:2px solid #8A6300;\" data-praxera-review=\"brand\">Praxera</span>\u00ae Laboratories has lower minimum order quantities than most private label supplement manufacturers. You can start with as little as 36 units, reducing your upfront expenses.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Ready to continue? Let\u2019s take your practice to the next level together! <a href=\"https://www.praxerasupplements.com/en/pl-demo-get-started\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\" rel=\"noopener\">Contact us</a> today.</p>\n</div>",
     "module_id": 1155639
    },
